---
// Landing page — เลือก Role
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="th">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>GPS Construction — เลือกบทบาท</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.2/css/all.min.css" />
    <style>
      * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; }
      body {
        font-family: 'Inter', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        /* Premium deep gradient background with subtle pattern */
        background: radial-gradient(circle at top right, #113626, transparent 40%),
                    radial-gradient(circle at bottom left, #0a1f16, transparent 40%),
                    linear-gradient(135deg, #0d2218 0%, #15382a 50%, #0a1912 100%);
        background-attachment: fixed;
        color: #fff;
        padding: 20px;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      /* Optional decorative elements */
      .bg-glow {
        position: absolute;
        width: 600px;
        height: 600px;
        background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(46, 204, 113, 0.15) 0%, transparent 70%);
        top: -200px;
        right: -200px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        pointer-events: none;
        z-index: 0;
      }
      .container { 
        position: relative;
        z-index: 10;
        max-width: 480px; 
        width: 100%; 
        text-align: center; 
        animation: fadeUp 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
      }
      @keyframes fadeUp {
        from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); }
        to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
      }
      .logo { 
        font-size: 3rem; 
        margin-bottom: 12px; 
        filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 12px rgba(46, 204, 113, 0.3));
      }
      h1 { 
        font-size: 1.8rem; 
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        margin-bottom: 8px; 
        background: linear-gradient(to right, #fff, #a8d5ba);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      }
      .subtitle { 
        color: #a8d5ba; 
        font-size: 0.95rem; 
        margin-bottom: 40px; 
        font-weight: 500;
      }
      .role-grid { 
        display: grid; 
        gap: 16px; 
      }
      .role-card {
        display: grid; 
        grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto;
        gap: 16px; 
        align-items: center;
        padding: 16px 20px;
        border-radius: 16px;
        /* Glassmorphism */
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
        -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
        box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
        text-decoration: none; 
        color: #fff;
        transition: all 400ms cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .role-card::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        top: 0; left: -100%;
        width: 50%; height: 100%;
        background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.1), transparent);
        transform: skewX(-20deg);
        transition: left 0.7s ease;
      }
      .role-card:hover::before {
        left: 150%;
      }
      .role-card:hover { 
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12); 
        transform: translateY(-4px) scale(1.02); 
        box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3), 0 0 0 1px rgba(46, 204, 113, 0.3);
      }
      .role-card:active { 
        transform: translateY(1px) scale(0.98); 
      }
      .role-icon {
        width: 56px; height: 56px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        display: grid; place-items: center;
        font-size: 1.4rem;
        box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgba(255,255,255,0.2), 0 8px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
      }
      .role-icon.trav { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1abc9c, #16a085); }
      .role-icon.con { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f1c40f, #f39c12); }
      .role-icon.adm { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3498db, #2980b9); }
      .role-info { text-align: left; }
      .role-info strong { 
        display: block; 
        font-size: 1.05rem; 
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 4px; 
      }
      .role-info span { 
        display: block;
        font-size: 0.8rem; 
        color: #a8d5ba; 
        line-height: 1.3;
      }
      .arrow-icon {
        color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        transition: transform 300ms ease;
      }
      .role-card:hover .arrow-icon {
        color: #fff;
        transform: translateX(4px);
      }
      .footer { 
        margin-top: 48px; 
        font-size: 0.75rem; 
        color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); 
        letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="bg-glow"></div>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="logo">🛣️</div>
      <h1>GPS Construction</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">รู้รอบก่อนเดินทาง — Data for Better Journey</p>

      <div class="role-grid">
        <a href="/traveler" class="role-card">
          <div class="role-icon trav"><i class="fa-solid fa-car"></i></div>
          <div class="role-info">
            <strong>ผู้เดินทาง (Traveler)</strong>
            <span>ดูแผนที่ แจ้งเตือนเขตก่อสร้าง<br>และวางแผนเส้นทาง</span>
          </div>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right arrow-icon"></i>
        </a>

        <a href="/contractor" class="role-card">
          <div class="role-icon con"><i class="fa-solid fa-helmet-safety"></i></div>
          <div class="role-info">
            <strong>ผู้รับเหมา (Contractor)</strong>
            <span>รายงานความคืบหน้า<br>และส่งรูปตรวจมาตรฐานหน้างาน</span>
          </div>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right arrow-icon"></i>
        </a>

        <a href="/admin" class="role-card">
          <div class="role-icon adm"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i></div>
          <div class="role-info">
            <strong>เจ้าหน้าที่ ทล. (Admin)</strong>
            <span>ใช้ AI ตรวจสอบมาตรฐาน<br>อนุมัติงาน และติดตาม KPI</span>
          </div>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right arrow-icon"></i>
        </a>
      </div>

      <p class="footer">DOH Hackathon 2026 — GPS Construction Platform</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
